<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of total U.S. mortgage applications fell 5.1 percent in the week ended August 23, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages fell 6.1 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages fell 4.8 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index fell 6.1 percent to 262.9 from 279.9 the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 2.7 percent to 172.8 in the latest survey from 177.6 in the previous week, it said.  </p>
